00:04:14.460 --> 00:04:16.426
whether or not that coping mechanism is

00:04:16.426 --> 00:04:18.550
(A) appropriate for who you are

00:04:18.550 --> 00:04:22.380
and (B) whether or not it
is distracting or detracting

00:04:22.380 --> 00:04:23.470
from your everyday life.

00:04:23.470 --> 00:04:26.080
- [Narrator] Stanley has
even tried baby formula,

